---
    title: Book Rating/Reviews
    layout: 'base.njk'
---

<h4>{{ title }}</h4>
<p>I regularly try to review the books I read but it's not always possible. In that case, sharing the rating is easiest. The criteria for the ratings is following:</p>
<div>
  <span>5⭐️: </span> Love it. It will stay with me forever <br>
  <span>4⭐️: </span> I was hooked from the beginning<br>
  <span>3⭐️: </span> Entertaining, but one time read<br>
  <span>2⭐️: </span> I barely managed to finish it<br>
  <span>1⭐️: </span> I abandoned it
</div>
<br>

<h3>Reading:</h3>
<section class="book-section-grid">
    {% for book in collections.books | reverse %}
        {% if book.data.status == "Reading" %}
            <div class="book-entry-grid">
                <a href= "{{ book.url }}">
                <img src="{{ book.data.cover }}" alt="{{ book.title }}">
                </a>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</section>

<br>

<h3>Finished:</h3>
<section class="book-section-grid">
    {% for book in collections.books | reverse %}
        {% if book.data.status == "Finished" %}
            <div class="book-entry-grid">
                <a href= "{{ book.url }}" class="book-cover">
                <img src="{{ book.data.cover }}" alt="{{ book.title }}">
                <div class="star-rating">
                    {% for i in range(book.data.rating) %}⭐{% endfor %}
                </div>
                </a>
            </div>
        {% endif %}
    {% endfor %}
</section>
